  "description": "Test build of Dr. Mundo as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Dr. Mundo so Goes Where He Pleases shakes off the first hard crowd control on the tick it lands (7% of current health) and he walks back to the chem-tank, Infected Bonesaw takes a share of the champion's current health, Blunt Force Trauma grows with his missing health, Heart Zapper stores a share of the real damage as grey health, and Maximum Dosage waits until his health runs low and heals a share of his missing health. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
